*.java text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# These are explicitly windows files and should use crlf.
# Keep the CRLF bytes as they are, in the repository too: Dependabot's gradle-wrapper
# updates commit gradlew.bat with CRLF, and "text eol=crlf" made that show as a whole-file diff.
# A new .bat created on Linux has to be saved with CRLF by hand.
*.bat           -text
